    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d226-a2">

                <pb facs="0590" n="554" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v11/pg554"/>

                <head>Enclosure C<anchor n="9" xml:id="d226-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1967-11-09">November 9, 1967</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="participants" type="description">
                    <label>MEMORANDUM FOR</label>
                    <item>Mr. Ben Read
                    </item>
                    <item>Executive Secretary</item>
                    <item>Department of State—S/S
                    </item>
                </list>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Latin American Nuclear Free Zone</item>
                </list>
                <p>In his conversation with President Diaz
                        Ordaz, the President told him that we intend to sign Protocol II
                    to the Latin American Nuclear Free Zone Treaty with an interpretive statement
                    after consultations with the Congress.</p>
                <p>State and ACDA are authorized to proceed with
                    consultations. The results of the consultations should be reported to the
                    President, together with recommendations for the handling of the
                    announcement.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#bold">Walt</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
